                                "sense_id": "73f8e5f0-acbe-345f-a53e-3fc9d62d12ee",
                                "text": "GLANS, in anatomy, the anterior extremity of the penis, called by other different names, as the head of the penis, the nut of the penis, and the balanus of the penis."
