                                "sense_id": "73f8e5f0-acbe-345f-a53e-3fc9d62d12ee",
                                "text": "There is both a local and a general predisposition to Lues Venerea: Jews and Mahometans, from the constant exposure of the glans and prepuce, have the cuticle of the balanus of much firmer texture than those who have not been circumcised."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a7fb55c-6c4d-4b51-a2c9-9cea77b961f2",
                                "sense_id": "73f8e5f0-acbe-345f-a53e-3fc9d62d12ee",
                                "text": "[...] and stretches into the balanus of the penis."
